      "writtenOn": "2021-12-16T16:00:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "How would this trigger? Until trusty_log_sfile_dev_open has been called, seems to contain a different type, but also not NULL. Are there any close paths where it gets set to NULL? If so, does it go back to the other type temporarily?",
      "revId": "a375da85873fb1afff209655445f14c04ed0f182",
